<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 19.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Jun 116.00/15.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckingham, Northampton, and Oxfordshire Jun 113.50 113.00/12.50/12.00/11.50/11.00</p>
<p>Avon range May 112.50/12.00 Jun 113.00/12.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Liverpool Mar 93.00</p>
<p>North Wales Jul 93.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire Jun 90.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jun 90.50/90.25</p>
<p>Ipswich May 89.75</p>
<p>Dorset May 88.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 96.00</p>
<p>Tilbury May 90.50/90.00</p>
<p>Essex/Suffolk Jun 91.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Cardiff May 88.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jun 92.50</p>
</text>
